{"reference":"Job 31","book":"Job","chapter":31,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Job’s Closing Case","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Job 31 forms the climax of a sequence that begins with Job 28’s contrast between human skill in uncovering ore and humanity’s inability to discover Wisdom’s place. Chapters 29–31 then move from Job’s memories of his former life to this searching ethical testimony and, finally, his formal demand that the Almighty answer him. This framing is disputed, and ancient textual forms of Job’s poetry are not verbally identical, so the particular textual witness in view matters.","verse_refs":["Job 10:1-22","Job 11:1-20","Job 12:1-25","Job 13:1-28","Job 14:1-22","Job 15:1-35","Job 16:1-22","Job 17:1-16","Job 18:1-21","Job 19:1-29","Job 1:1-22","Job 20:1-29","Job 21:1-34","Job 22:1-30","Job 23:1-17","Job 24:1-25","Job 25:1-6","Job 26:1-14","Job 27:1-23","Job 28:1-28","Job 29:1-25","Job 2:1-13","Job 30:1-31","Job 32:1-22","Job 33:1-33","Job 34:1-37","Job 35:1-16","Job 36:1-33","Job 37:1-24","Job 38:1-41","Job 39:1-30","Job 3:1-26","Job 40:1-24","Job 41:1-34","Job 42:1-17","Job 4:1-21","Job 5:1-27","Job 6:1-30","Job 7:1-21","Job 8:1-22","Job 9:1-35"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_job_031_718f6af67c1434ef9db76e54"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"},{"id":"block_2","text":"A later passage names Job in connection with suffering, patience or endurance, and the Lord’s compassionate outcome. That association is disputed in its precise sense: Job’s endurance may describe persistence through the story or its eventual outcome, but it should not be taken to require silent acceptance of abuse or to forbid escape and protection.","verse_refs":["Job 10:1-22","Job 11:1-20","Job 12:1-25","Job 13:1-28","Job 14:1-22","Job 15:1-35","Job 16:1-22","Job 17:1-16","Job 18:1-21","Job 19:1-29","Job 1:1-22","Job 20:1-29","Job 21:1-34","Job 22:1-30","Job 23:1-17","Job 24:1-25","Job 25:1-6","Job 26:1-14","Job 27:1-23","Job 28:1-28","Job 29:1-25","Job 2:1-13","Job 30:1-31","Job 32:1-22","Job 33:1-33","Job 34:1-37","Job 35:1-16","Job 36:1-33","Job 37:1-24","Job 38:1-41","Job 39:1-30","Job 3:1-26","Job 40:1-24","Job 41:1-34","Job 42:1-17","Job 4:1-21","Job 5:1-27","Job 6:1-30","Job 7:1-21","Job 8:1-22","Job 9:1-35"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_job_031_0d3ab1cb56e7a54da1685fd6"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}